  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Jun 17 2029

    I shouldn''t have taken this job. These mushrooms - they''re
    capable of so much more than glowing in response to sound. I thought we''d be
    studying the properties of the invisible ink they secrete, but I was naive. If
    that was all, why would the lab be hidden away like this?

'
